ts and tons of weapons to knock people into the water! This game also features tons of cool cosmetic and social features, so it's easy to express how you want to look!", "short_description": "Doodlebotz is a fun and unique, multiplayer VR, battle-sandbox game, all about chaos! Use gadgets and your build gun to make structures, destroy them, and knock people into the water! This game also features tons of cool cosmetic and social features, so it's easy to express how you want to look!"}]}, "developer_name": "Loaf Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/loaf-games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Loaf Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/loaf-games/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8508281575907620"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001656_1720418265426570_6302861996801774419_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCAGREcjmPwQ7kNvwEhNPg-&_nc_oc=AdpxYSAOFVEzjx2SE2G6tdgjqA-8L7Ifw5nRfaZ6Jx1GfXim6Wr6p2vXxUadlloCETY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHok5Y48WKgJBLA7vWQ6n95PK8dY6Nd0GA191W-0vht5Q&oe=6A8ED1A4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Doodlebotz: U